This is related to the comment "// @@@ Adding same object(not same reference) with ArrayList returns object reference in the list" in Add function. This line add same value into ArrayList, it checks after adding reference that ArrayList size is 1 and first element is actually equal to it. We use a Debug.Assert to check this condition holds true or not. 

